{
 "source": "trapp",
 "book": "1CH",
 "chapter": 16,
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "trapp/1CH.16.1",
   "range": "1CH.16.1",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "727b03d8",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/1CH.16.1#p1-727b03d8",
     "text": "Those pointed them to Christ, freeing them from their sins, both from the crime and from the curse: these taught them thankfulness for Christ, and all benefits in and by him.",
     "anchor": "Ver. l. And they offered burnt sacrifices and peace offerings"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/1CH.16.2",
   "range": "1CH.16.2",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "94f00b7d",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/1CH.16.2#p1-94f00b7d",
     "text": "i.e., From Jehovah, the fountain and bestower of all good. Or, By the name of the Lord; i.e., by naming the Lord, the proper object of prayers and praises.",
     "anchor": "In the name of the Lord"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/1CH.16.3",
   "range": "1CH.16.3",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "4d50c6de",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/1CH.16.3#p1-55bafaba",
     "text": "Clemency and liberality are kingly virtues. See 2Sa 6:19.",
     "anchor": "And he dealt to every one of Israel.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "2Sa 6:19",
       "ref": "2SA.6.19"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "trapp/1CH.16.3#p2-69e98809",
     "text": "Of roast beef, as some gather from the notation of the word here used.",
     "anchor": "A good piece of flesh."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/1CH.16.4",
   "range": "1CH.16.4",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "5c09b390",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/1CH.16.4#p1-9377af03",
     "text": "Or, To declare and publish.",
     "anchor": "And to record."
    },
    {
     "id": "trapp/1CH.16.4#p2-119b3b60",
     "text": "God is good, and so is the object of praise. He also doeth good, and so is the object of thanks.",
     "anchor": "And to thank and praise."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/1CH.16.5",
   "range": "1CH.16.5",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "d383a349",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/1CH.16.5#p1-d383a349",
     "text": "Yet in other places Heman is set before him. {1Ch 6:33; 1Ch 6:39; 1Ch 15:16-17}",
     "anchor": "Asaph the chief.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ch 6:33",
       "ref": "1CH.6.33"
      },
      {
       "text": "1Ch 6:39",
       "ref": "1CH.6.39"
      },
      {
       "text": "1Ch 15:16-17",
       "ref": "1CH.15.16-17"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/1CH.16.6",
   "range": "1CH.16.6",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "c1e6835b",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/1CH.16.6#p1-c1e6835b",
     "text": "That is, Constantly at set hours.",
     "anchor": "Continually."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/1CH.16.7",
   "range": "1CH.16.7",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "59c6bc44",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/1CH.16.7#p1-59c6bc44",
     "text": "David, \"the sweet psalmist of Israel.\" {2Sa 23:1}",
     "anchor": "David delivered.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "2Sa 23:1",
       "ref": "2SA.23.1"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/1CH.16.8",
   "range": "1CH.16.8",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "51c72641",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/1CH.16.8#p1-51c72641",
     "text": "This psalm was sung in times of any great joy, as may be gathered from Isa 12:4.",
     "anchor": "Call upon his name.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Isa 12:4",
       "ref": "ISA.12.4"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/1CH.16.9-11",
   "range": "1CH.16.9-11",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "b8294f94",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/1CH.16.9-11#p1-b8294f94",
     "text": "Ver. 9-11], {See Trapp on \"Psa 105:1\"} {See Trapp on \"Psa 105:2\"} {See Trapp on \"Psa 105:3\"} &c.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Psa 105:1",
       "ref": "PSA.105.1"
      },
      {
       "text": "Psa 105:2",
       "ref": "PSA.105.2"
      },
      {
       "text": "Psa 105:3",
       "ref": "PSA.105.3"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/1CH.16.23",
   "range": "1CH.16.23",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "701474ac",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/1CH.16.23#p1-701474ac",
     "text": "See Psa 96:1, &c {See Trapp on \"Psa 96:1\"} &c",
     "anchor": "Sing unto the Lord.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Psa 96:1",
       "ref": "PSA.96.1"
      },
      {
       "text": "Psa 96:1",
       "ref": "PSA.96.1"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/1CH.16.34",
   "range": "1CH.16.34",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "a42b4c0d",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/1CH.16.34#p1-a42b4c0d",
     "text": "See on Psa 107:1.",
     "anchor": "O give thanks to the Lord.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Psa 107:1",
       "ref": "PSA.107.1"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/1CH.16.35",
   "range": "1CH.16.35",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "e981bd05",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/1CH.16.35#p1-b7bbbeb3",
     "text": "Pitch upon fit attributes in prayer: this will both strengthen faith and excite affection.",
     "anchor": "Save us, O God of our salvation."
    },
    {
     "id": "trapp/1CH.16.35#p2-f4d8cd5a",
     "text": "Which we both pray that we may, and promise that we will do.",
     "anchor": "That we may give thanks."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/1CH.16.37",
   "range": "1CH.16.37",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "009b1068",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/1CH.16.37#p1-009b1068",
     "text": "As every day’s work required.] Or, To do every day what he did on one day: for we must continue thankful."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/1CH.16.38",
   "range": "1CH.16.38",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "81f41b09",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/1CH.16.38#p1-81f41b09",
     "text": "That is, Obededom and Hosan.",
     "anchor": "And Obededom."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/1CH.16.39",
   "range": "1CH.16.39",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "134b1457",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/1CH.16.39#p1-134b1457",
     "text": "For hither was the tabernacle brought, after that brutish slaughter of the priests by Saul at Nob. {1Sa 22:11-19}",
     "anchor": "That was at Gibeon.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Sa 22:11-19",
       "ref": "1SA.22.11-19"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/1CH.16.43",
   "range": "1CH.16.43",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "347cbc47",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/1CH.16.43#p1-347cbc47",
     "text": "See on 2Sa 6:20.",
     "anchor": "And David returned to bless his house.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "2Sa 6:20",
       "ref": "2SA.6.20"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}
